# Middleware, TLS & DoS Reviewer Rule v1.0 STRICT

**Do not inline-audit.** Invoke **`middleware_tls_dos_reviewer`** -> `.cursor/agents/middleware_tls_dos_reviewer.md`.

## References

| Artifact | Path |
|---|---|
| Policy | `.cursor/skills/middleware_tls_dos_reviewer/POLICY.md` |
| Scan skill | `.cursor/skills/middleware_tls_dos_reviewer/SKILL.md` |
| Report path | `AI/middleware_tls_dos_reviewer/middleware_tls_dos_reviewer_report.md` |
| Report line | `middleware_tls_dos_reviewer v1.0 STRICT` |

**POLICY.md wins.**

## Invoke when

Use before deploy or when `application.properties` proxy/TLS settings, `SecurityFilterChain` channel security, outbound HTTP client beans, multipart configurations, or Spring Boot parent versions change.

Skip for generated output, `target/`, `node_modules/`, and docs-only edits unless the docs define transport policy.

## Non-negotiable rules

1. **Transmitting passwords or cookies over HTTP is always FAIL.**
2. **Outbound HTTP clients without explicit timeouts is always FAIL.**
3. **Missing request body size limits is always FAIL.**

## Finding table

Every finding includes:

| Row | Content |
|---|---|
| Evidence | Bad line or runtime proof from project |
| Policy Rule | POLICY.md - CHECK-ID - citation |
| Pattern | SKILL.md section 8 pattern |
| Mechanism | Plain English + framework/API names |
| Security property | What must be true after fix |
| Prohibited | Short label only |
| Verify | Action + pass signal |

Allowed verdicts: **PASS**, **FAIL**, **MANUAL_REVIEW**, **N/A**. `UNCLEAR` is forbidden.
